1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:03,880
(Raj:)Then you have nothing
to worry about.

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:06,680
(Leonard:)No, I do not.

3
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:11,650
(Leonard:)You are a mean little man.

4
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:15,050
(Raj:)You'd think it'd be because
my parents didn't love me,

5
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,220
(Raj:)but actually they
loved me a great deal.

6
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,790
(Howard:)Bernie, it's not you.

7
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:23,160
(Howard:)She's just set
in her ways.

8
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,460
(Bernadette:)How can we be together
if the thought of us

9
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,260
(Leonard:)getting married
might kill your mother?

10
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:31,270
(Howard:)It's the circle
of life, sweetie.

11
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:37,070
(Howard:)One day our son will marry
someone and it will kill you.

12
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,010
(Sheldon:)Howard, I have to go
to the bathroom

13
00:00:41,010 --> 00:00:42,440
(Sheldon:)and no one
will take me home.

14
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:44,280
(Howard:)What's wrong with
the bathroom here?

15
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:47,680
(Sheldon:)Pneumococcus, streptococcus,
staphylococcus

16
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,980
(Sheldon:)and other assorted
coccuses.

17
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:52,880
(Howard:)Sheldon, my mother is
on her deathbed

18
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,950
and my fiancée is grief-stricken
over putting her there.

19
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:56,590
(Howard:)I'm not taking you home.

20
00:00:56,590 --> 00:00:58,290
(Sheldon:)Will you at least

21
00:00:58,290 --> 00:00:59,660
(Sheldon:)go with me to the restroom here,

22
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:01,790
(Sheldon:)so you can open the door
and flush the urinal?

